                <head>266. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>A memorandum of a conversation regarding Cyprus, March 20, held at the Mid-Ocean
                    Club among President Eisenhower, Secretary Dulles, Prime Minister Macmillan, and
                    Foreign Secretary Lloyd, is quoted in an editorial note in volume XXIV, page
                    464.</p>
